	(gr_text "TinyTapeout designs are packaged \ntogether along with a MUX that \nallows for directing I/O to \nany selected project, controlled \nthrough the cINC, cEN and ~{cRST} \npins.\n\nThis PCB provides a way to \ndeliver these chips that will\nsit atop the demo board, but \nalso allows you to easily \nintegrate the ICs into your\nown projects. For details, see\n"
